
# type(scope): summary
#
#   type   feat fix perf refactor test docs style build ci chore revert
#   scope  generator layouts components themes app presenter cli dev export build
#          offline mcp tests docs deps ci (or leave it out)
#   summary  imperative, lower case, no period, 72 characters at most
#
# Body (optional, after a blank line): why the change is needed, and how it
# behaves now compared with before. Do not add trailer lines.
#
# See docs/contributing/commit-message-guidelines.md
